Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:04.16,Default,Jailer,0,0,0,,Lord Nada has come all \Nthis way to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.36,Default,Jailer,0,0,0,,Greet him properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.85,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You seem \Nso lethargic, lowlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:12.98,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,I am Nada. I will be the next king.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:19.73,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,It seems you had no idea what would \Nhappen if you went against me, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:22.62,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Now! Obey my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:27.30,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I intend to hold a\Ntournament for my royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:29.70,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,If you win, I will reward \Nyou with twenty bags of gold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.53,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,and the position of a supreme \Nofficer in my royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:35.96,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Surely, that will tempt you to \Nput your skills to good use?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:37.69,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,I have no need for the position.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:42.23,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,However, if you'll set \Nme free in return...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.55,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,I'll obediently do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:46.58,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.56,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,I have yet to know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.53,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Izark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.82,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,He looks like a little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:03.32,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,Are they getting him all cleaned \Nup for tomorrow's tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.86,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,He's taking a relaxing bath, \Nwith no clue
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:07.87,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,what we're going to do to him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:09.71,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.76,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,Oh, Barago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:14.21,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,What're you doing, carrying \Naround a bottle of liquor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:18.60,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,Well, after that kind of embarrassment, \Nanyone would want to get drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:22.97,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Hey, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:24.59,Default,Zago Soldier 2,0,0,0,,Lord Barago, what are you...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:25.96,Default,Zago Soldier 1,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.06,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Because of you, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.10,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.47,0:01:30.88,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:34.01,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Even though I made it this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:35.03,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.96,0:01:38.36,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,Has he gone crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:40.41,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.74,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,I wanted to be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:51.24,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,I wanted to be strong and \Nrespected by those around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:55.28,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,I worked hard to climb \Nthe ranks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:59.06,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,Sucks to fall down hard like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:07.13,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,But before I knew it, I was only focused \Non scoring more points for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.40,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,And this is the result of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:13.80,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,How pathetic... How uncool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.49,0:02:17.78,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,I worked so hard for such \Na shitty guy like Nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:21.82,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,Once I realized that,\N I could no longer sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:28.20,italics,Barago,0,0,0,,I hate you, so I don't care \Nwhether you believe me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:30.73,italics,Barago,0,0,0,,But I'll at least tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:36.73,italics,Barago,0,0,0,,In tomorrow's match, you'll be fighting \Nall seventeen of us by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:40.11,italics,Barago,0,0,0,,If you don't want to die,\Nfind a way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.52,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.34,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,No wonder I couldn't feel any \Nmurderous intent from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:48.97,italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,Izark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:53.18,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,Noriko? No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:57.11,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,After that, I couldn't connect to her, \Nno matter how many times I tried...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.38,italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,Izark!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:00.44,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Noriko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.20,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,Izark?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.95,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,I got through to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:21.22,top,Title,0,0,0,,FROM FAR AWAY
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:42.71,top,Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7: \NSEVENTEEN AGAINST ONE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:45.51,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Seventeen against one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.29,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:51.52,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,One person is going to fight seventeen \Ntough-as-nails guys like these?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:56.16,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,No matter how skilled this wandering \Nwarrior is, this is basically a lynching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:12.53,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,We will now begin today's tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:16.05,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,They're all crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:22.47,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to save Izark \Nin a situation like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:25.17,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,For the first match!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.48,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,The contestant Izark Kia Tarj!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:38.44,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Before us stands a wandering warrior that \Nclaims himself to be the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:41.48,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Therefore, for today's first match,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:47.08,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,I have decided to have him face my \Nseventeen royal guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:56.43,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'll be able to \Nshow us a magnificent battle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.43,0:06:00.09,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,that matches his arrogant attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:03.20,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Let us all enjoy the show to the fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:16.72,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,How about that? Surprised?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:20.73,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,He must be so flustered \Nthat he's frozen in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:27.43,Default,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,So that's Izark...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:30.71,Default,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,He's the wandering warrior that \Ntraveled with Noriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:38.68,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:41.87,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,Even if I lend a hand, we can't \Ntake seventeen guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:44.07,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:46.92,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,He's the man who defeated Keimos, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.40,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,There must be a way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:51.00,Default,Jeida,0,0,0,,Stop this now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.26,Default,Jeida,0,0,0,,This is not a match!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.66,Default,Jeida,0,0,0,,Why is no one stopping this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:58.26,Default,Jeida,0,0,0,,We can't let such an outrageous \Nact go unpunished!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.72,Default,Crowd 1,0,0,0,,It's Grand Duke Jeida!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.70,Default,Spectator 1,0,0,0,,He's just a criminal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:05.69,Default,Spectator 2,0,0,0,,Isn't this a wonderful spectacle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.92,Default,Crowd 5,0,0,0,,He's just a wandering warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:10.27,Default,Crowd 5,0,0,0,,What's there to raise his voice about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:13.78,Default,Zago Soldier 3,0,0,0,,I can't. I can't bear to watch \Nthis, it's too pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.90,Default,Cook,0,0,0,,No one can defy Lord Nada...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:19.91,Default,Jeida,0,0,0,,Let us all file a complaint!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.41,Default,Jeida,0,0,0,,This kind of match should \Nbe stopped immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:25.17,Default,Zago Soldier 4,0,0,0,,Shut up! Sit and watch quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:26.53,Default,Rontarna,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:28.18,Default,Koriki,0,0,0,,Father, are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.92,Default,Crowd 1,0,0,0,,Shut up, criminal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.96,Default,Crowd 2,0,0,0,,Hurry up and start the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:32.74,Default,Crowd 5,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.92,Default,Crowd 6,0,0,0,,Shut up, old geezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:40.06,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,First match! Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:46.66,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:49.27,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,I'm going first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.13,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,Barago, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:07:55.95,Default,Orne,0,0,0,,Whatever. Let him do what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:08:00.45,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,You idiot! You didn't \Nbelieve what I told you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:02.67,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,It's not that I didn't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.71,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,I was just thinking things over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:06.95,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:11.72,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Do you even understand \Nyour current situation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:17.02,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,If you're still willing to \Nhelp me, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.72,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Contestant Barago has been eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:25.19,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:27.28,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,All right! I'm next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:28.85,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,The real show starts now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:32.14,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,I had plenty of chances to run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:38.83,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,But all this time, I couldn't decide...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:41.95,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:48.84,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,This guy is just messing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.50,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,What are you all dawdling for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:53.64,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Hurry up and hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:55.63,Default,Contender 2,0,0,0,,All right! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:10.77,Default,Contender 3,0,0,0,,This bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:13.54,Default,Contender 1,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:15.40,Default,Contender 3,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:27.43,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Izark Kia Tarj has defeated six \Npeople in the blink of an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:29.92,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,No, seven people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.81,Default,Crowd 2,0,0,0,,Hey, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:33.42,Default,Crowd 6,0,0,0,,This guy is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:38.76,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,He's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.74,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,But can he hold out against \Nten more people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:44.22,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Why are you watching with that \Nstupid look on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:45.05,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:58.37,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You're \Nnot attacking anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.95,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,He's making a fool of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.62,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,H-Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.97,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,What do you mean you have \Na message from Izark?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:18.41,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,You're Agol, right? \NA mercenary with a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:19.47,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:23.40,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,I don't know much about {\i1}that{\i0}, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.96,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,That?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:29.06,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Anyways, we need to get everything done \Nwhile he's distracting the crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:30.97,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Get what done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:34.11,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,But what's he planning to do \Nwith all of that anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.49,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:50.08,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Another one down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:55.62,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,What are all of you doing?! \NThere's only one opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:59.14,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,My honor is at stake here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:02.31,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Hurry up and beat him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:05.77,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,Everyone, forget your playful \Nattitude about this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:09.77,Default,Kadar,0,0,0,,This guy is really strong.\NWe need to take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.11,Default,Contender 8,0,0,0,,We don't need you to tell us that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:14.27,Default,Orne,0,0,0,,We can't let this guy underestimate us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.48,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:22.06,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,None of you are a match for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:24.62,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,Fight to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:27.43,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,You guys are the prelude for\Nmy moment in the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.67,0:11:43.01,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Noriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:46.99,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Are you sure you just want us to \Nwait here on the outskirts of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:50.02,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,Yes. That's what Izark said to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.69,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,I wanted to get away from Noriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:12:00.16,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,That's why I entrusted her to \NGaya and left on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.15,Default,Orne,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:05.77,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,But Gaya got caught up in an incident \Ninvolving Grand Duke Jeida and his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:10.45,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,It's no longer safe for \NNoriko to stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.45,Default,Contender 9,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:17.04,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,Should I go back to Noriko's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.55,Default,Contender 11,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.67,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,These scale-like cracks...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:34.06,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,I've had them since I was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:37.05,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,but they've definitely spread \Nafter meeting Noriko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:42.06,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Now, twelve men have been \Neliminated! Only five are left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:50.56,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,If I can restore the peace around \NGaya and entrust Noriko to her again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:53.94,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,I won't have to see Noriko anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.31,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:00.55,flashback italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,Izark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:02.34,flashback,Izark,0,0,0,,Noriko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:04.65,flashback italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. I got through to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:08.19,flashback italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,But I can't see you. I can \Nonly hear your voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:11.77,flashback italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:13.34,flashback,Izark,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:16.13,flashback,Izark,0,0,0,,I can only hear your voice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:20.79,flashback italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, a person named \NAgol will go to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:23.16,flashback italics,Noriko,0,0,0,,He should be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:39.29,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,We only parted ways a few days ago, \Nso why do I miss her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:42.62,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:54.00,italics,Izark; Internal,0,0,0,,Why do I want to see her again so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.76,0:13:56.98,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,It's so strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:14:01.97,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,I can feel Izark's presence so clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:05.88,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,I feel like I'm not here, \Neven though I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:13.62,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,I feel like I've melted into \Nthe air and sense Izark within it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.83,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,What in the world is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:21.82,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,I feel like I'm enveloped in \Nsomething huge and vast...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.79,0:14:29.34,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Izark!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:37.92,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,An intruder! A new contestant \Nhas joined the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.17,0:14:40.57,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,I've brought you what \Nyou asked Barago for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.31,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,When I give the signal,\Nrescue the Grand Duke of the Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:44.33,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:47.06,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,But what are you planning to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:50.73,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Put an end to this farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.69,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.47,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,No one can defeat him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.47,0:15:05.55,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,There are hardly any people \Nleft that can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.73,italics,Kaidar; Internal,0,0,0,,And Lord Nada is trembling with despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:15.45,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,Only one remains!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.72,Default,Manager,0,0,0,,The final showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.97,0:15:23.23,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Kaidar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:25.97,Default,Nada,0,0,0,,Finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:29.59,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,It's my turn now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:34.76,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,Taste my poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.88,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,Now, fall down in defeat, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:57.27,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd fall for \Nthe same trick twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:05.77,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,That's... No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:09.85,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Okay! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:10.52,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.77,0:16:16.02,Default,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,Lord Barago?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.67,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Get outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:18.66,top,Zago Soldier 2,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.15,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Jeida of the Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.15,0:16:25.42,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Please cover your nose and mouth \Nwith a cloth and take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.43,0:16:44.96,Default,Crowd 5,0,0,0,,What's this wind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.44,Default,Crowd 2,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:58.39,Default,Zago Soldier 1,0,0,0,,My... My body...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.01,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.09,Default,Kaidar,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.78,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,This is your poison, Kaidar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:12.16,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,I took it from your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:15.51,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,The one that doesn't kill you\Nbut is a powerful paralyzing drug...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.99,0:17:18.42,italics,Barago; Internal,0,0,0,,Agol was the one who picked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:31.57,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,Even so, he possesses such \Nincredible strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.33,0:17:36.08,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,What is the relationship between \NNoriko and this young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:42.74,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,Izark and the others are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:45.08,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are they? I don't see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:47.59,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.89,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Looks like they were all \Nable to safely escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:09.22,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Everyone! I'm happy to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:10.73,Default,Geena,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:14.88,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Gaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.37,0:18:19.35,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,It's not just an image in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:23.09,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,I brought another horse. Ride this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:25.39,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,It's not just his voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:26.86,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Noriko, get on my horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:28.75,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,It's the real
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:31.65,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,Izark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:36.73,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:49.40,italics,Agol; Internal,0,0,0,,Oh, he's blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.90,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,Noriko, hurry up and get on the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:56.78,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,What am I doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:59.27,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:00.55,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:03.67,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,From Izark's perspective, \Nhe was finally free of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:05.41,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,but now we're together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:09.29,Italics - Isekai,Noriko; Internal (J),0,0,0,,This isn't a happy situation for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:14.80,Default,Noriko,0,0,0,,Safe. At ease. That's why \NI hugged. Different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:19.05,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,I see you haven't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:23.84,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.70,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,Here, Mr. Agol.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.43,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.43,Default,Geena,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:32.03,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,There. There. Were you a good girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:38.60,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,Geena, did you look into Noriko?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:44.04,Default,Geena,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. Um, I couldn't find anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:45.60,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:50.60,italics,Geena; Internal,0,0,0,,Big Sister was the same as \Nwhen I divined the Awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.03,0:19:52.86,italics,Geena; Internal,0,0,0,,Everything was mixed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:55.09,italics,Geena; Internal,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.47,0:19:58.97,italics,Geena; Internal,0,0,0,,That person...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:05.64,italics,Geena; Internal,0,0,0,,I shouldn't tell Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:08.44,italics,Geena; Internal,0,0,0,,That's what my gut is telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:12.85,Default,Kemil,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:21.98,Default,Kemil,0,0,0,,I heard Jeida was captured and \Ncame to see him in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:23.36,Default,Kemil,0,0,0,,Where in the world is Lord Nada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:24.55,Default,Kemil,0,0,0,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.38,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:35.12,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,We need to decide how we're getting \Nout of this country fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.88,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,I'm sure our pursuers \Nwill be coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:39.22,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,I think we should escape to \Nneighboring Guzena
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:40.93,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,through the White Mist Woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.93,0:20:44.13,Default,Banadam,0,0,0,,No! Even if it's farther, we \Nshould go through a checkpoint!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:46.00,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,A checkpoint, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:50.42,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're expecting us \Nto flee the country as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.15,0:20:54.65,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,In that case, every route will \Nbe under strict surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.65,0:20:58.65,Default,Banadam,0,0,0,,But the White Mist Woods is also \Nknown as the Forest of Evil...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:02.65,Default,Banadam,0,0,0,,They say that you can never \Nleave once you enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:06.93,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,That's precisely why the woods \Nare a blind spot for Kemil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:11.99,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,More importantly, this was the \Npath the seer girl saw, Banadam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:21.78,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,If that's what Geena predicted, \Nwe're destined to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.68,Default,Agol,0,0,0,,It can't be avoided, either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:24.92,Default,Izark,0,0,0,,It's settled then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.54,Default,Gaya,0,0,0,,By the way, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:36.43,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,A man who has no choice but \Nto tag along with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:37.73,Default,Barago,0,0,0,,Don't worry too much about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:44.07,italics,Noriko; Narration (J),0,0,0,,And with that, our new adventure began.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:45.44,top,Text,0,0,0,,WHITE MIST WOODS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:54.52,Default,Hair Monster,0,0,0,,Humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:57.35,Default,Hair Monster,0,0,0,,Kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:13.41,top,credits,0,0,0,,Translator: Angela Tamae Liu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:17.87,top,credits,0,0,0,,Timer: Edgar Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:22.42,top,credits,0,0,0,,Editor: Salem Alabanza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:32.84,top,credits,0,0,0,,Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.51,0:22:36.51,top,credits,0,0,0,,Final Quality Control: Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:07.21,Default,Irktule,0,0,0,,She's here!

